 ## Operating characteristics
 *   **Time Complexity:** Interactive frame rates for up to several $10^5$ particles [S1, unofficial].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** High shared memory usage (~1900 bytes per packet). Node-cache (~300 bytes), Slab-cache (~1536 bytes for weighted results) [S1, unofficial].
